      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Fixed: after updating PortWin while Steam (or another Windows program) was open, games launched from Steam crashed at start. PortWin now updates its Wine engine only once no programs are using it. If you hit this in 1.24, click “Stop All” in the Steam bottle and open Steam again.</li></ul>]]></description>
